Details:
  TestName: builderReturnsNewBuilderInstance
  Description: Verify that the static builder() method returns a non-null Builder instance that can be used to construct an ApigeeLlm object.
Execution:
  Arrange: No setup required.
  Act: Call ApigeeLlm.builder() to obtain a Builder instance.
  Assert: Assert that the returned Builder is not null.
