  Assert: Assert that the result of the chained calls is not null and is an instance of ApigeeLlm.Builder.
Validation:
  This test validates the fluent API design of the Builder pattern, ensuring that setter methods return the Builder instance for chaining. This is essential for the usability and readability of the API.

